<br><a data-href="RxDB" href="01-concepts/rxdb.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">RxDB</a> - Database replication over libp2p streams
<br><a data-href="adr-251110-libp2p-vs-simple-peer" href="04-architecture/adr/adr-251110-libp2p-vs-simple-peer.html" class="internal-link" target="_self" rel="noopener nofollow">adr-251110-libp2p-vs-simple-peer</a> - Why we chose libp2p <br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://docs.libp2p.io/" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://docs.libp2p.io/" target="_self">libp2p Documentation</a>
<br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p" target="_self">js-libp2p GitHub</a>
<br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p-examples" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://github.com/libp2p/js-libp2p-examples" target="_self">libp2p Examples</a>
<br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://docs.libp2p.io/concepts/" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://docs.libp2p.io/concepts/" target="_self">libp2p Concepts</a> Utility process: app/src/utility/p2p-service.ts
Test peer: test-peer/src/index.js
Protocol handler: app/src/main/protocol.ts Issue: libp2p Integration
Future: Protocol implementation roadmap <br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://github.com/ipfs/ipfs-desktop" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://github.com/ipfs/ipfs-desktop" target="_self">IPFS Desktop</a> - Electron + libp2p in production
