<br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://react.dev/blog/2024/12/05/react-19" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://react.dev/blog/2024/12/05/react-19" target="_self">React 19 Release Notes</a>
<br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://zustand.docs.pmnd.rs/" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://zustand.docs.pmnd.rs/" target="_self">Zustand Documentation</a>
<br><a data-tooltip-position="top" aria-label="https://rxjs.dev/guide/subscription" rel="noopener nofollow" class="external-link is-unresolved" href="https://rxjs.dev/guide/subscription" target="_self">RxJS Subscription</a> Hooks: app/src/renderer/hooks/
Navigation store: app/src/renderer/stores/navigation-store.ts
User store: app/src/renderer/stores/user-store.ts
useDatabase: app/src/renderer/hooks/useDatabase.ts
useRxDBDocument: app/src/renderer/hooks/useRxDBCollection.ts
Session hooks: useSessionState, useTrackSource, usePlaybackState
